// v1 — changes need a pull request approved by a project manager.
//
// MatchDataService fetches players' matches (HenrikDev in development, Riot's
// API in production), stores them, and hands out game-neutral stats.
// It is the only service that reads or writes the `matchdata` tables.
// It only ever holds data for players who linked their account (opted in).
//
// Callers: AccountService (SyncPlayer, DeletePlayerData),
//          RoomService (GetSyncStatus),
//          QuizService (GetPlayerMatchStats),
